  "frame_title": "Two-stroke layer: perimeter + infill as separate closed loops",
  "frame_description": "An outer boundary square (perimeter) and a concentric inner square (infill), printed as two independent closed strokes with distinct roles. Edge-disjoint and Eulerian-complete, and each degree-2 loop is trivially crossing-free -- but not single-stroke (k=2, disconnected components). Demonstrates multi-stroke, multi-role toolpaths.",
